SUMMARY:Deadline: Stimuleringsfonds: Architecture Grant Scheme 2026
DESCRIPTION:The Stimuleringsfonds Architecture Grant Scheme supports archit
 ects\, observers\, design agencies and cultural institutions on projects a
 cross the broad field of architecture\, including design research\, reflec
 tion and public debate as well as built work. Solo projects receive EUR 10
 \,000-25\,000\, projects with partners up to EUR 50\,000\, with at least 2
 0 percent co-financing. This round opens 13 August 2026 at 15:00 CEST and 
 closes 19 August 2026 at 16:00 CEST. From 2026 the scheme allocates places
  by notary-supervised lottery draw rather than by order of submission. App
 licants must be registered with the Dutch Chamber of Commerce (KvK).\n\nOr
 ganisation: Stimuleringsfonds Creatieve Industrie (Creative Industries Fun
 d NL)\nLocation: Netherlands. Requires establishment in the Kingdom of the
  Netherlands and Dutch Chamber of Commerce (KvK) registration.\nAward: EUR
  10\,000-25\,000 for a single executing party\; EUR 10\,000-50\,000 with p
 roject partners. Minimum 20 percent co-financing. Round budget EUR 587\,94
 6 (2026 total EUR 1\,155\,000). No application fee.\nDuration: Project-bas
 ed.\n\nMore: https://www.stimuleringsfonds.nl/en/grants/architecture-grant
 -scheme?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.stimuleringsfonds.nl/en/grants/architecture-grant-scheme?ut
 m_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Netherlands. Requires establishment in the Kingdom of the Netherla
 nds and Dutch Chamber of Commerce (KvK) registration.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stimuleringsfonds-professionalisation-practice-development-2026@artific
 ialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20260827T221258Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260917
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260918
SUMMARY:Deadline: Stimuleringsfonds: Open Call Professionalisation and Prac
 tice Development 2026
DESCRIPTION:Open call from the Creative Industries Fund NL supporting desig
 ners in deepening and professionalising their own practice rather than del
 ivering an external client project. It funds practice development across d
 esign\, architecture\, digital culture and the crossovers between them\, a
 nd the Fund explicitly names digital storytellers and sound designers amon
 g eligible practitioners\, which makes it one of the more accessible route
 s for a maker working between technology and art. ELIGIBILITY: designers w
 ith an independent practice of at least four years\, established in the Ne
 therlands or the Caribbean part of the Kingdom. Temporary collectives may 
 apply with one lead applicant. Grants run from EUR 8\,250 to EUR 28\,250. 
 The window runs 19 August 2026\, 15:00 CEST to 17 September 2026\, 16:00 C
 EST.\n\nOrganisation: Stimuleringsfonds Creatieve Industrie (Creative Indu
 stries Fund NL)\nLocation: Netherlands or the Caribbean part of the Kingdo
 m. Requires an independent design practice of at least four years.\nAward:
  EUR 8\,250 to EUR 28\,250 per applicant. Total budget EUR 300\,000\, incr
 eased for 2026. No application fee.\nDuration: Project-based.\n\nMore: htt
 ps://www.stimuleringsfonds.nl/en/grants/open-call-professionalisation-and-
 practice-development?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=refe
 rral
URL:https://www.stimuleringsfonds.nl/en/grants/open-call-professionalisatio
 n-and-practice-development?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_mediu
 m=referral
LOCATION:Netherlands or the Caribbean part of the Kingdom. Requires an inde
 pendent design practice of at least four years.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
